Financial area and Secretary should be able to:
	- Filter completed work by client.
	- Select a billing period.
	- Review unbilled work.
	- Group work by patient and work type.
	- Calculate quantities and subtotals.
	- Apply the relevant client pricing.
	- Generate a professional invoice and billing statement in PDF.
	- Mark work as invoiced and record payment status.

	(SSII Electronic invoicing process)
